// Native application identity of the "staging" flavor (iOS). Selected by the Xcode
// scheme "staging" and its Debug/Profile/Release-staging configurations, i.e. by
// `flutter build ios --flavor staging`. Only identity lives here; the environment
// (backend, network) comes from config/build/staging.json, and the build fails
// unless the two agree (lib/config/build_config.dart). See docs/BUILD_CONFIGURATION.md.
PRODUCT_BUNDLE_IDENTIFIER = com.app.cadenabitcoin.staging
APP_DISPLAY_NAME = Cadena Signer STAGING
